(7617816, 1233433, 59740, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. To me it says that spring is coming. Nice.</td>', 'Beautiful. To me it says that spring is coming. Nice.', '2019-03-07 17:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617817, 1233409, 59740, '<td valign="top">Nice try but too many distracting details.</td>', 'Nice try but too many distracting details.', '2019-03-07 17:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617818, 1233412, 59740, '<td valign="top">Nice capture but the focus i near the lizard''s hind legs and not on the face.</td>', 'Nice capture but the focus i near the lizard''s hind legs and not on the face.', '2019-03-07 17:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617820, 1233451, 59740, '<td valign="top">Your photo to me is pretty much a snapshot with not much attention to composition. The building is slanted for not particular reason, there are many distracting details, and the interaction between the people is uncertain. The costumes say Mardi Gras but nothing else speaks to me.</td>', 'Your photo to me is pretty much a snapshot with not much attention to composition. The building is slanted for not particular reason, there are many distracting details, and the interaction between the people is uncertain. The costumes say Mardi Gras but nothing else speaks to me.', '2019-03-07 17:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617821, 1233391, 59740, '<td valign="top">This has the makings of a great photo if the sky were more interesting. I would crop most of it out.</td>', 'This has the makings of a great photo if the sky were more interesting. I would crop most of it out.', '2019-03-07 17:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617823, 1232446, 59740, '<td valign="top">Most of your photo is out of focus. Also the man made objects in the foreground serve no purpose and should be cropped out or removed.</td>', 'Most of your photo is out of focus. Also the man made objects in the foreground serve no purpose and should be cropped out or removed.', '2019-03-07 17:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617825, 1233394, 59740, '<td valign="top">I love the left 1/3 of the photo. I would crop it to a vertical.</td>', 'I love the left 1/3 of the photo. I would crop it to a vertical.', '2019-03-07 17:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617828, 1233130, 59740, '<td valign="top">This picture is almost great. What I think it needs is more interest in the water. Maybe there is some detail that could be brought out in processing. Also, I think the horizon is a little tilted to the right.</td>', 'This picture is almost great. What I think it needs is more interest in the water. Maybe there is some detail that could be brought out in processing. Also, I think the horizon is a little tilted to the right.', '2019-03-07 17:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617829, 1233366, 59740, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but the right side of the jug is a little underexposed causing it to blend into the background and lose detail.</td>', 'Nice composition but the right side of the jug is a little underexposed causing it to blend into the background and lose detail.', '2019-03-07 17:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617830, 1233168, 59740, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.</td>', 'Very nice portrait.', '2019-03-07 17:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617831, 1232790, 59740, '<td valign="top">To me, this still life does not have enough detail in focus.</td>', 'To me, this still life does not have enough detail in focus.', '2019-03-07 17:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617832, 1233384, 59740, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Great composition and beautiful colors. A winner!</td>', 'Lovely. Great composition and beautiful colors. A winner!', '2019-03-07 17:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617833, 1233292, 59740, '<td valign="top">I would like to see one of the cars in what I assume is an aerial tram. Nice treatment of the clouds. I guess this was done with a slow exposure.</td>', 'I would like to see one of the cars in what I assume is an aerial tram. Nice treatment of the clouds. I guess this was done with a slow exposure.', '2019-03-07 17:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617834, 1233372, 59740, '<td valign="top">The bird is the subject but it has been overpowered by the feeder which is out of focus. Nice snapshot.</td>', 'The bird is the subject but it has been overpowered by the feeder which is out of focus. Nice snapshot.', '2019-03-07 17:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617835, 1232689, 59740, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower. It is so hard to keep enough in focus when doing a closeup and this one misses because at least the whole center should be sharp (my opinion).</td>', 'Beautiful flower. It is so hard to keep enough in focus when doing a closeup and this one misses because at least the whole center should be sharp (my opinion).', '2019-03-07 17:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617837, 1233358, 59740, '<td valign="top">All the makings of a really good photo are here but I think there is too much. I would crop off everything to the left of the foreground tree and in the process would remove the tilted building corner. I would also tone down the building so that it isn''t so bright.</td>', 'All the makings of a really good photo are here but I think there is too much. I would crop off everything to the left of the foreground tree and in the process would remove the tilted building corner. I would also tone down the building so that it isn''t so bright.', '2019-03-07 17:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617840, 1232469, 59740, '<td valign="top">I bet this is Singapore. I can see the corner of the hotel on the left edge. I think this would make a better composition by cropping to the left of the fireworks and by making the horizon straight.</td>', 'I bet this is Singapore. I can see the corner of the hotel on the left edge. I think this would make a better composition by cropping to the left of the fireworks and by making the horizon straight.', '2019-03-07 17:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617841, 1233413, 59740, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. I am trying to decide whether I would like it better with the verticals straightened or just like it is? Nice capture and great color and exposure.</td>', 'Fantastic. I am trying to decide whether I would like it better with the verticals straightened or just like it is? Nice capture and great color and exposure.', '2019-03-07 17:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7617842, 1232806, 59740, '<td valign="top">Not bad but not enough WOW for me.</td>', 'Not bad but not enough WOW for me.', '2019-03-07 17:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
