(7617848, 1233442, 59740, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. With the possible cropping of the right side, I can find no faults. Great shot.</td>', 'Beautiful. With the possible cropping of the right side, I can find no faults. Great shot.', '2019-03-07 17:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
