(7618162, 1233442, 156466, '<td valign="top">Dropping in on my way back out to let Jane know just how proud I am of her accomplishment. I had a bunch of goals here before I left and the only one I never got was winning a Free Study (though I notice that the people who managed to relegate me to 2nd multiple times didn''t enter - but this ain''t about me. And hey, I DID win the unofficial yearly crown so... LOL). Regardless, having been a part of this adventure with Jane it''s a pure testimony to "It''s not the tool, it''s the craftsman", and Jane is an Amish beachgoers magnet, which is a surefire recipe for amazing shots. <br/> <br/>This is the epitome of street photography meets beach/bird photography and I love the heck out of it. It deserves to be celebrated and you all did just that. Congrats, Jane!!</td>', 'Dropping in on my way back out to let Jane know just how proud I am of her accomplishment. I had a bunch of goals here before I left and the only one I never got was winning a Free Study (though I notice that the people who managed to relegate me to 2nd multiple times didn''t enter - but this ain''t about me. And hey, I DID win the unofficial yearly crown so... LOL). Regardless, having been a part of this adventure with Jane it''s a pure testimony to "It''s not the tool, it''s the craftsman", and Jane is an Amish beachgoers magnet, which is a surefire recipe for amazing shots.  This is the epitome of street photography meets beach/bird photography and I love the heck out of it. It deserves to be celebrated and you all did just that. Congrats, Jane!!', '2019-03-08 17:41:04.000000', NULL, 0),
