(7618586, 1233102, 30669, '<td valign="top">I am very happy to have this ribbon. First for me. Thanks for all the comments.<br/>This shot was a bracketed 3 photo image processed in Photomatix Pro6.<br/> <br/>The lake is located in Kensington Metro Park outside of Detroit. It is a great place for walking and the island in the photo has large Great Blue Heron nests which they will be returning to this month.</td>', 'I am very happy to have this ribbon. First for me. Thanks for all the comments.This shot was a bracketed 3 photo image processed in Photomatix Pro6. The lake is located in Kensington Metro Park outside of Detroit. It is a great place for walking and the island in the photo has large Great Blue Heron nests which they will be returning to this month.', '2019-03-10 11:07:29.000000', NULL, 0),
